      "date": "2026-02-09T00:08:21.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.39 (vs ₹2.90 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.39 (down from ₹2.90 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹142.0m (down 70% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹15.4m (down 47% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 11% (up from 6.1% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 86% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 34% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
