      "date": "2025-12-31T08:16:00.000Z",
      "title": "MRP Agro Limited Approves the Appointment of Akanksha Aswani as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer Designated as Key Managerial Personnel of the Company, Effective January 01, 2025",
      "body": "MRP Agro Limited approved the appointment of Ms. Akanksha Aswani (ACS-41662) a qualified company secretary as company secretary and Compliance Officer designated as Key Managerial Personnel of the company, effective January 01, 2025 as per the recommendation of Nomination and Remuneration Committee.  Ms. Akanksha Aswani (ACS-41662) has been appointed as the Whole Time Company Secretary & Compliance Officer of the Company. Ms. Akanksha Aswani is an Associate Member of the Institute of Company Secretaries of India (Membership No. ACS- 41662) and has 07-year experience in dealing with matters of Companies Act, Listing Regulations and allied laws.",
